{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c3a9d0c40940239f112e89ec8832602490bce0cb04b73eb52b4d8142cb8cf9c", "ja": "（39プロジェクトに相応しい、アイドル候補……\n次はいったい、どんな子かな？）", "zh": "（适合39PROJECT的偶像人选……\n下一位究竟会是怎么样的女孩呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5ec30be6f0b472025be140cacc835a37fd165e27dc429e7c5692cb2305240fb2", "ja": "アタシ、舞浜歩！\n特技はダンスです、よろしくぅ！！", "zh": "我叫舞滨步！\n专长是跳舞，请多指教！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "456f39f4f4cb0f9a12bbfdd4752c73391274076ac6c7b7bb954d8f911775577c", "ja": "はは、元気だね。\nそれじゃ、まずは自己PRをお願いします。", "zh": "哈哈，真有精神啊。\n那么，请你先自我推荐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a9947f042666be1e57d2cd55400397bd4f2406936917ffd21af3151eebeb50c0", "ja": "あ～。口で言うより、踊ってみせたほうが早いかな？\n……それじゃ、見ててくれよ！", "zh": "啊～与其用嘴巴讲，不如直接跳给你看比较快吧？\n……要开始啰，你要看好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a32d8ee5d6049fd7864c1390694f60dbd50e6112f69e0c4b32bcba48fa64d37d", "ja": "えっ？\n……うわっ！？", "zh": "什么？\n……唔哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "03f42fe78652a02578b99d296043753d766a78f832e358775bca1943252cae98", "ja": "（す、すごい本格的なダンスだ！\nこれは、今すぐプロで通用するんじゃないか……？）", "zh": "（好、好精湛的舞技！\n这完全不输专业的吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1006_null", "source_sha256": "94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329", "ja": "数分後……", "zh": "过了几分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b41ada942b7c04168ec918f1ecc40ab8e73ef999f2c10f7db2f056e9422df231", "ja": "へへん♪\nどうだった？　アタシのダンス！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n你觉得我跳得怎么样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "84aacefa5e4d9865c0bcb9a341e2ad508748a1febcc44b8696ee8f94093285a6", "ja": "いや……すごいよ！\nダンスは、どこかのスクールで習ってたのかな？", "zh": "这真是……太厉害了！\n你有读过舞蹈学校吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0b8107d74f1756c5c601785caac4f770a93db45f8c98c6784e96b9c6895bbad0", "ja": "まーね！\nちょっと、アメリカでね。へへっ♪", "zh": "对啦！\n我以前去美国读过，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cd5f88f24fa85e49e58e4853202dbeac702038ae235932723fc59b630a8d04d4", "ja": "あ、アメリカ！？", "zh": "美、美国！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a7486f632fd3a7323101815daa2df8012864df19941557174861d61224ad94d", "ja": "小さい頃から、兄貴の影響でダンスやっててさ。\n最近まで、アメリカにダンス留学してたんだ！", "zh": "我从小就受大哥的影响开始跳舞，\n一直在美国留学念舞蹈直到最近喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6c748acc89fe60e7073c029d1329831026d640ced1b6eb5103417f657e520ace", "ja": "アメリカでは、R&B、HIPHOP、ジャズ……\nいろんなダンスや音楽を習ったよ。", "zh": "我在美国学会R&B、HIPHOP、爵士乐……\n学了各式各样的舞蹈和音乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5ae691cbe5fede1da0569460d0d81e8a6214dd2cab441a41af3b7145d8b7552f", "ja": "そうか、それで……。でも、だったらどうして、\nダンサーを目指さなかったのかな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才这么厉害……不过，\n既然如此，为什么不去当舞者呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4ccd1b7525f391978ae91b10d2672cdfac5db2bed52d68302e6bd6471d680c2b", "ja": "最初は、そのつもりだったよ！　ダンスに\n自信がついたから、日本に帰ってきたんだ。", "zh": "一开始我的确是这么打算的啊！\n我自认舞技已经成熟了，所以才回来日本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f05ad25f8bd7f53194e4e3cb79d5411b36f3fb3711569aa540cb3e5f1524d18", "ja": "帰ってきてすぐ、街に買い物に行って……\nそこで初めて、アイドルのステージを生で見て！", "zh": "一回来我就立刻上街买东西……\n然后就第一次亲眼看见偶像的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1bb050b5a257696dbacb8e6a7bde3d0b6e2c06f8c8cbc5a59f1bda01cfa3551e", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれで、どうだった？", "zh": "原来如此。\n然后呢？你觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e65d82cb0f08660e8f3c8523eb657fd4cb7f3ffa2d4a80c1f5b7265349759faa", "ja": "すっ……ごく、驚いた！\nまさに、カルチャーショックってカンジだったよ！", "zh": "我吃了好……大一惊！\n简直就是文化冲击啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a2ef69734551be42747ee2e3d32b815f97727f35439a894b52cc297e35ee5010", "ja": "「マイガ～ッ！？　すごい！\nこんなダンス＆ステージ、見たことないよ～っ！」", "zh": "「My God～！？好厉害！\n我从来没见过这么棒的舞蹈＆表演～！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "56ee6f1fceba0c8b02656555d2ebcd5e8cb75ecb9d1c68dfae5f608cf8fc3281", "ja": "って、思わず叫んじゃってさ！\nやっぱり日本人って、未来に生きてるな～って！", "zh": "我不禁这样大叫！\n觉得日本人真的是走在时代尖端耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "34e3376add9a5acf1f16dcfd312271ab3efe9ba795b3cd7cd77d3c8e85314933", "ja": "（留学してまで本格的なダンスを学ぶ積極性、\nその上でアイドルに可能性を見出すセンス……）", "zh": "（不惜出国学习道地舞蹈的积极态度、\n再加上能看出偶像行业潜力的眼光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "191cec3d10822889dc907023185a777706214bfde4a4b8d9a4b717d823cf98c4", "ja": "その時に、思ったんだ！　アタシも、\nこんな風に歌ったり踊ったりしてみたいって！", "zh": "就在那个时候我突然想到！\n我也想像那样唱歌跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2665376fc0f262cafeda7828a509481d9750bb2d2a930c7a0e520fd19f4f23d7", "ja": "歌って踊れる、ダンサブルなアイドルだよ！\n……ねっ、すっごくイイと思わない！？", "zh": "我要当个能唱又能跳、舞力全开的偶像！\n……你说，这样是不是很棒啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0c70742d13e0808daf7005cf50fb2a39c481f56aebebd45283626a2c8a810a9f", "ja": "ああ、すごくいいと思うよ。\n方向性がハッキリしてて。", "zh": "是啊，我也觉得很棒。\n方向很明确。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "51a25a454458a0fbc5bf39bd341e51e15b79863ce4cd1a0161407b392371220a", "ja": "（この子は、なかなかの逸材かもしれない！）", "zh": "（这女孩或许是个难得一见的奇才！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "45e9344fa29b52fee8f352bee7e89aec0ea0102932fa5efd4f1394f68e8bf3d4", "ja": "でも、今までダンサー志望だったからさ。どうやって\nアイドルになればいいのか、わからなくて……。", "zh": "可是，我一直以来的目标都是舞者，\n所以不知道该如何才能当上偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3691396108e08a98355601f6fdbbb5207c6c4039bda57a3983556bdf38cffe22", "ja": "そしたら、ダンス教室の先生が、\n39プロジェクトの話を教えてくれたんだ！", "zh": "就在这个时候，舞蹈教室的老师告诉我\n39PROJECT的消息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dc5531f2b831c9fabc7b2bbf8a473ae88a5f355bf13f30ccc2dcc63d9deb6523", "ja": "もう絶対、運命だって思ってさ！\nいても立ってもいられなくて、応募したんだ。", "zh": "我觉得这一定是命中注定的！\n于是就迫不及待地报名了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8631d60d741d0836b8d096d241a378ba867c77b5affc95507a47c96e1056a3ee", "ja": "……よく分かったよ。\n話してくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "……我都理解了。\n谢谢你和我分享。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "addf2086ee0097dcffa730bfd7189312a364766e7197d275719949c5853bc1c6", "ja": "えっと……あ、あのさ？", "zh": "那个……请、请问一下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6273916608c3c81790ee4cbfa55155caeffcedb996cf354636d83a1c85199f0b", "ja": "アタシ、今までダンスしかしてこなかったし。\nアイドルって感じじゃないかもだけど……。", "zh": "我一直以来都专注在舞蹈上，\n所以可能没什么偶像的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fceb7f3f350aced27b209e1877dd1470aa90d2ea06903398820b56f3298aa933", "ja": "……アタシみたいな子でも、\nアイドルになれるかな？", "zh": "……像我这样的人，\n也当得上偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_1033", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5fc829bb32268b7f890db2980e29f81f7011474c03df11ebfc0c4d6173000a79", "ja": "もちろん、なれるよ。\n舞浜歩さん、合格だ！", "zh": "你肯定当得上的。\n舞滨步小姐，恭喜你录取了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_034ayu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_034ayu_001_2001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c7ecf7c418d1c9cf67562e413bfd9cfd1db3f6abef5d0a2a414e2ba91e50c61f", "ja": "えっ……ほ、ホントに！？\nアタシ、合格したのっ！？", "zh": "咦……真、真的吗！？\n我录取了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
